Name: fontsan
Short Name: fontsan
URL: https://github.com/servo/fontsan
Version: 0.7.0
Revision: 04d3e6cc12893731bb916ece3afe3bf93cb8089e
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py fontsan, history replayed linearly)
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Sanitiser for untrusted font files

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/fontsan/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/fontsan/ unchanged.

Crates:
  fontsan 0.7.0 third_party/fontsan/fontsan
